1
00:00:06,880 --> 00:00:09,720
=The Forgotten Concubine's Revenge=

2
00:00:09,920 --> 00:00:12,760
=Episode 10=

3
00:00:12,920 --> 00:00:15,720
(From this day on,
it's war to the death!)

4
00:00:16,120 --> 00:00:18,240
Be careful, Concubine Rou.

5
00:00:20,920 --> 00:00:22,600
Your Highness's diagonal moves

6
00:00:23,120 --> 00:00:24,440
show great force.

7
00:00:24,520 --> 00:00:26,360
But you're too eager to win.

8
00:00:26,520 --> 00:00:27,680
Within three moves,

9
00:00:27,880 --> 00:00:29,680
you'll have nowhere left to go.

10
00:00:30,760 --> 00:00:31,360
But...

11
00:00:32,040 --> 00:00:33,240
Which three moves?

12
00:00:36,200 --> 00:00:36,920
Here.

13
00:00:38,000 --> 00:00:38,720
Here.

14
00:00:39,600 --> 00:00:40,920
And here.

15
00:00:43,480 --> 00:00:46,000
That's the Oriole Snatching a Butterfly.

16
00:00:46,320 --> 00:00:47,920
I've only seen it in books.

17
00:00:48,120 --> 00:00:49,240
Sharp eyes, Your Highness.

18
00:00:49,960 --> 00:00:51,120
I concede.

19
00:00:51,160 --> 00:00:52,320
The harem says

20
00:00:52,360 --> 00:00:54,400
Concubine Rou has beauty but no wit.

21
00:00:54,520 --> 00:00:56,240
Now I've seen for myself.

22
00:00:56,240 --> 00:00:57,560
They were wrong about you.

23
00:00:59,200 --> 00:00:59,880
Mother.

24
00:01:00,000 --> 00:01:00,800
Zhaoyi Rong.

25
00:01:02,600 --> 00:01:04,960
Your Highness.

26
00:01:05,400 --> 00:01:08,520
I heard the eldest prince praise
Concubine Rou from afar.

27
00:01:08,800 --> 00:01:10,120
I had some free time,

28
00:01:10,240 --> 00:01:12,240
so I played a few rounds with him.

29
00:01:12,400 --> 00:01:13,480
Concubine Rou is

30
00:01:13,480 --> 00:01:14,520
truly remarkable!

31
00:01:14,520 --> 00:01:16,240
I've never seen moves like hers.

32
00:01:16,280 --> 00:01:18,360
She's even better than
the palace masters.

33
00:01:18,600 --> 00:01:19,400
I never knew

34
00:01:19,400 --> 00:01:21,880
Concubine Rou was such a skilled player.

35
00:01:22,000 --> 00:01:22,840
Not at all.

36
00:01:23,080 --> 00:01:24,360
I studied for a while.

37
00:01:24,560 --> 00:01:27,080
Fortunately, I obtained a unique copy
of a chess manual

38
00:01:27,280 --> 00:01:28,920
and memorized a few endgames.

39
00:01:29,160 --> 00:01:29,920
Concubine Rou.

40
00:01:30,360 --> 00:01:32,520
Which manual was it?

41
00:01:33,240 --> 00:01:34,280
The Rotten Axe Manual.

42
00:01:34,760 --> 00:01:36,080
Have you heard of it?

43
00:01:36,320 --> 00:01:37,360
Of course I have.

44
00:01:37,800 --> 00:01:38,640
But...

45
00:01:38,840 --> 00:01:41,520
That manual was lost long ago.

46
00:01:41,600 --> 00:01:42,280
Concubine Rou.

47
00:01:42,520 --> 00:01:43,280
You really have it?

48
00:01:43,400 --> 00:01:44,000
Of course.

49
00:01:44,360 --> 00:01:46,720
It has a game called
the Rotten Axe Immortal Trace.

50
00:01:47,120 --> 00:01:49,000
They say its author

51
00:01:49,000 --> 00:01:51,560
played against an immortal in a dream.

52
00:01:51,800 --> 00:01:52,760
It's fascinating.

53
00:01:53,440 --> 00:01:54,880
Would you like to read it?

54
00:01:55,240 --> 00:01:56,080
I'd love to!

55
00:01:56,560 --> 00:01:57,560
Thank you, Concubine Rou.

56
00:02:00,040 --> 00:02:02,600
(Yongxiu Palace)

57
00:02:05,320 --> 00:02:06,280
Concubine Rou.

58
00:02:06,880 --> 00:02:07,920
A word in private, please.

59
00:02:13,600 --> 00:02:16,320
You found this rare manual

60
00:02:16,680 --> 00:02:17,840
just to get close to

61
00:02:17,840 --> 00:02:19,320
the eldest prince, didn't you?

62
00:02:21,880 --> 00:02:23,000
What do you mean?

63
00:02:26,960 --> 00:02:28,520
What a clever scheme.

64
00:02:29,040 --> 00:02:30,600
This missing page

65
00:02:30,920 --> 00:02:33,600
holds the solution to its endgame.

66
00:02:34,040 --> 00:02:36,280
I suspect you gave it to the prince

67
00:02:36,440 --> 00:02:38,200
knowing he couldn't solve it.

68
00:02:38,280 --> 00:02:39,560
So he must come to you.

69
00:02:39,880 --> 00:02:41,200
Back and forth

70
00:02:41,280 --> 00:02:43,320
and who knows what follows.

71
00:02:44,920 --> 00:02:45,640
Zhaoyi Rong.

72
00:02:46,040 --> 00:02:47,280
What nonsense!

73
00:02:48,160 --> 00:02:49,160
Nonsense or not,

74
00:02:49,160 --> 00:02:50,440
you know it yourself.

75
00:02:52,880 --> 00:02:55,280
Noble Consort Hui put you up to this,
didn't she?

76
00:02:56,160 --> 00:02:58,800
Everyone knows Consort Qi
has shown you great kindness.

77
00:02:58,840 --> 00:03:00,720
Yet you plot against her son.

78
00:03:00,800 --> 00:03:03,160
I'll let everyone in this harem see

79
00:03:03,240 --> 00:03:04,480
what kind of person you are.

80
00:03:04,480 --> 00:03:06,520
A two-faced ingrate!

81
00:03:06,600 --> 00:03:08,120
Come with me. We're seeing Consort Qi.

82
00:03:08,200 --> 00:03:08,760
Move!

83
00:03:08,960 --> 00:03:09,400
No.

84
00:03:10,000 --> 00:03:11,240
Don't tell Consort Qi.

85
00:03:11,280 --> 00:03:12,160
So you admit it.

86
00:03:15,120 --> 00:03:16,280
How did you find out?

87
00:03:16,800 --> 00:03:18,400
I know you're working together.

88
00:03:18,920 --> 00:03:21,640
And I know things you don't.

89
00:03:23,040 --> 00:03:26,000
Noble Consort Hui wants you
to seduce the eldest prince

90
00:03:26,240 --> 00:03:29,000
and make him commit an unforgivable act

91
00:03:29,000 --> 00:03:29,920
to anger His Majesty.

92
00:03:30,640 --> 00:03:32,360
That way, the second prince

93
00:03:32,360 --> 00:03:34,400
can take his place as crown prince.

94
00:03:35,200 --> 00:03:35,840
Am I right?

95
00:03:40,280 --> 00:03:42,320
I know a terrible secret.

96
00:03:42,600 --> 00:03:44,000
Once you hear it,

97
00:03:44,440 --> 00:03:47,240
you won't dare join
Noble Consort Hui's scheme.

98
00:03:47,920 --> 00:03:48,960
Do you believe me?

99
00:03:53,640 --> 00:03:54,680
Listen carefully.

100
00:03:56,280 --> 00:03:57,400
The second prince

101
00:03:58,600 --> 00:04:00,360
is not His Majesty's son.

102
00:04:04,240 --> 00:04:05,400
This secret is deadly.

103
00:04:05,400 --> 00:04:06,200
If word gets out,

104
00:04:06,800 --> 00:04:08,040
your entire clan

105
00:04:08,120 --> 00:04:09,960
will pay with their lives.

106
00:04:10,200 --> 00:04:13,160
Do you think Noble Consort Hui
will spare you?

107
00:04:13,760 --> 00:04:16,800
She'll kill everyone involved.

108
00:04:17,120 --> 00:04:19,680
Once it's done,
you'll be the first to die.

109
00:04:21,960 --> 00:04:22,680
But...

110
00:04:23,640 --> 00:04:24,600
How can that be?

111
00:04:24,600 --> 00:04:26,120
Why couldn't it be true?

112
00:04:26,120 --> 00:04:28,120
Anything can happen in this harem.

113
00:04:28,360 --> 00:04:30,000
You'd even set a trap

114
00:04:30,000 --> 00:04:31,480
to make the eldest prince
covet a consort.

115
00:04:31,480 --> 00:04:32,960
You'd do all that,

116
00:04:33,160 --> 00:04:35,720
Why couldn't Noble Consort Hui
have a child with another man?

117
00:04:38,880 --> 00:04:40,080
Even if that's true,

118
00:04:40,480 --> 00:04:42,000
now that I know everything,

119
00:04:42,080 --> 00:04:43,440
it's too late for me now.

120
00:04:43,640 --> 00:04:45,320
I have no way out.

121
00:04:45,600 --> 00:04:47,800
If I fail her,

122
00:04:47,800 --> 00:04:48,920
I'll die too.

123
00:04:49,480 --> 00:04:51,400
And my mother will be implicated.

124
00:04:54,120 --> 00:04:54,920
Concubine Rou.

125
00:04:55,800 --> 00:04:57,760
We must have some self-respect.

126
00:04:58,280 --> 00:05:00,920
No one is worth giving up your life for.

127
00:05:01,320 --> 00:05:02,160
Besides...

128
00:05:02,480 --> 00:05:04,960
If your mother knew you'd died for her,

129
00:05:06,120 --> 00:05:07,480
would she ever find peace?

130
00:05:11,320 --> 00:05:12,120
No.

131
00:05:12,440 --> 00:05:13,240
That's not true.

132
00:05:14,000 --> 00:05:16,560
You only want revenge for
Princess Lingxi.

133
00:05:16,840 --> 00:05:18,640
You just want to use me against her.

134
00:05:18,760 --> 00:05:20,320
You're all using me.

135
00:05:23,280 --> 00:05:24,080
Zhaoyi Rong.

136
00:05:24,440 --> 00:05:25,600
You have your obsession.

137
00:05:25,920 --> 00:05:27,680
I have people I must protect.

138
00:05:27,960 --> 00:05:30,360
Let's just do our part.

139
00:05:30,960 --> 00:05:32,120
Besides,

140
00:05:32,960 --> 00:05:34,600
you're barely keeping yourself afloat.

141
00:05:35,360 --> 00:05:36,400
You can hardly save yourself.

142
00:05:49,160 --> 00:05:49,960
How grand!

143
00:05:49,960 --> 00:05:52,880
(Madam Zhao, Fu Rong's mother)

144
00:05:52,960 --> 00:05:54,320
(Longfu Gate)

145
00:05:54,320 --> 00:05:54,840
Slow down.

146
00:05:58,160 --> 00:05:59,000
How splendid!

147
00:06:00,400 --> 00:06:01,200
Slow down.

148
00:06:02,320 --> 00:06:03,920
Slow down! Wait for me!

149
00:06:04,040 --> 00:06:06,360
(That's Fu Rong's mother, Madam Zhao.)

150
00:06:06,960 --> 00:06:09,280
(Why is she entering with
a maid from Chengxi Palace?)

151
00:06:10,600 --> 00:06:12,080
Go ahead. I'll catch up.

152
00:06:12,080 --> 00:06:12,880
Sure.

153
00:06:21,040 --> 00:06:21,840
Physician Li.

154
00:06:21,960 --> 00:06:22,760
Your Highness.

155
00:06:22,880 --> 00:06:24,160
I just saw outside that

156
00:06:24,360 --> 00:06:25,320
your mother entered the palace.

157
00:06:25,560 --> 00:06:26,760
My daughter is a Zhaoyi.

158
00:06:26,920 --> 00:06:27,880
Who would dare stop me?

159
00:06:30,960 --> 00:06:31,160
Your Highness!

160
00:06:31,160 --> 00:06:31,880
Auntie.

161
00:06:35,320 --> 00:06:36,640
You ungrateful girl.

162
00:06:37,000 --> 00:06:38,800
You've lived in luxury all these years.

163
00:06:38,960 --> 00:06:40,720
Have you ever thought of your family?

164
00:06:40,920 --> 00:06:42,200
If not for Noble Consort's kindness

165
00:06:42,200 --> 00:06:42,920
and brought me here,

166
00:06:43,120 --> 00:06:44,080
we wouldn't even know

167
00:06:44,080 --> 00:06:45,760
you'd moved into Jinghe Palace.

168
00:06:46,360 --> 00:06:47,160
What?

169
00:06:47,360 --> 00:06:49,960
Now a Zhaoyi, you can't even speak?

170
00:06:51,440 --> 00:06:54,680
I hear you thrive here,

171
00:06:55,000 --> 00:06:56,440
but before your mother

172
00:06:56,760 --> 00:06:58,080
and you've gone mute?

173
00:06:58,320 --> 00:06:59,240
Watch your tongue!

174
00:06:59,320 --> 00:07:00,960
Why haven't you bowed to Her Highness?

175
00:07:01,760 --> 00:07:02,880
Who do you think you are?

176
00:07:03,120 --> 00:07:05,160
How dare a maid speak to me like that?

177
00:07:06,000 --> 00:07:07,080
Kneel!

178
00:07:08,240 --> 00:07:08,720
Auntie!

179
00:07:09,040 --> 00:07:11,000
Zhaoyi Rong was appointed by
His Majesty.

180
00:07:11,000 --> 00:07:12,080
The ruler comes before one's parents.

181
00:07:12,080 --> 00:07:12,800
She can't kneel.

182
00:07:12,800 --> 00:07:13,720
You, Li!

183
00:07:14,160 --> 00:07:16,360
I advise you not to meddle.

184
00:07:16,840 --> 00:07:17,720
Besides,

185
00:07:18,000 --> 00:07:19,040
this is family business,

186
00:07:19,040 --> 00:07:20,520
you have no say in it.

187
00:07:20,720 --> 00:07:22,200
I gave birth to Fu Rong.

188
00:07:22,360 --> 00:07:23,360
Even if she became Empress,

189
00:07:23,360 --> 00:07:24,520
I'd still be her mother.

190
00:07:24,760 --> 00:07:26,360
I'll make her kneel today.

191
00:07:26,640 --> 00:07:28,680
What, will you punish me?

192
00:07:28,920 --> 00:07:29,240
But...

193
00:07:29,240 --> 00:07:30,120
Enough.

194
00:07:31,600 --> 00:07:32,280
Chunli.

195
00:07:32,680 --> 00:07:34,480
You and Physician Li may leave.

196
00:07:35,320 --> 00:07:35,960
Fu Rong.

197
00:07:36,920 --> 00:07:37,600
Yes.

198
00:07:39,200 --> 00:07:40,720
Physician Li, this way.

199
00:07:56,240 --> 00:07:56,640
Chunli.

200
00:07:57,040 --> 00:07:58,000
Go see to your duties.

201
00:07:58,040 --> 00:07:58,560
But...

202
00:07:58,560 --> 00:07:59,800
It's all right. Go.

203
00:08:00,680 --> 00:08:01,480
Yes.

204
00:08:07,120 --> 00:08:08,920
Now you're a Zhaoyi.

205
00:08:09,160 --> 00:08:10,240
You've grown powerful.

206
00:08:10,360 --> 00:08:11,600
You look down on me now?

207
00:08:12,000 --> 00:08:12,920
Let me tell you.

208
00:08:13,240 --> 00:08:14,680
No matter how high you rise,

209
00:08:14,800 --> 00:08:16,800
you still came from my womb.

210
00:08:16,840 --> 00:08:18,880
My blood runs in you!

211
00:08:21,920 --> 00:08:22,400
Mother.

212
00:08:22,960 --> 00:08:24,360
I haven't forgotten you.

213
00:08:24,560 --> 00:08:25,840
Nor have I forgotten Father

214
00:08:25,840 --> 00:08:26,920
or my younger brother.

215
00:08:27,120 --> 00:08:29,160
But I'm truly powerless.

216
00:08:29,320 --> 00:08:30,880
I can't control what happens outside.

217
00:08:31,160 --> 00:08:32,800
If not for the Noble Consort

218
00:08:32,800 --> 00:08:34,120
bringing me in,

219
00:08:34,280 --> 00:08:36,600
I'd never know your good life.

220
00:08:37,480 --> 00:08:39,080
You're comfortable now.

221
00:08:39,440 --> 00:08:40,720
Why don't you speak up

222
00:08:40,720 --> 00:08:42,480
for your father and brothers?

223
00:08:42,720 --> 00:08:45,040
What did I tell you
before you entered the palace?

224
00:08:47,040 --> 00:08:47,840
Mother.

225
00:08:48,800 --> 00:08:50,160
The harem can't meddle in state affairs.

226
00:08:50,560 --> 00:08:52,240
Noble Consort Hui is wicked.

227
00:08:52,600 --> 00:08:54,200
She's setting a trap for our family.

228
00:08:54,280 --> 00:08:55,800
She wants us all dead.

229
00:08:55,920 --> 00:08:57,920
Please don't believe her lies.

230
00:08:58,040 --> 00:08:59,440
Nonsense about no meddling!

231
00:09:00,120 --> 00:09:02,720
Others rely on daughters to win favor

232
00:09:02,840 --> 00:09:03,720
and raise their fortunes.

233
00:09:03,720 --> 00:09:04,520
When one prospers, all prosper.

234
00:09:04,520 --> 00:09:05,480
When one falls, all fall.

235
00:09:05,640 --> 00:09:06,600
Others can do it.

236
00:09:06,600 --> 00:09:07,600
Why can't you?

237
00:09:08,000 --> 00:09:09,560
What use are you then?

238
00:09:10,440 --> 00:09:12,240
I thought once you became a consort,

239
00:09:12,240 --> 00:09:13,480
you'd help your father and brothers

240
00:09:13,480 --> 00:09:14,600
rise in rank and status.

241
00:09:14,600 --> 00:09:15,120
And what?

242
00:09:16,080 --> 00:09:17,680
How have you repaid us?

243
00:09:17,760 --> 00:09:19,840
After all these years,
you finally got summoned,

244
00:09:19,880 --> 00:09:21,440
only to bear a useless mute!

245
00:09:21,960 --> 00:09:23,400
Even His Majesty ignores her.

246
00:09:23,800 --> 00:09:25,720
Your belly is useless too.

247
00:09:25,920 --> 00:09:27,200
If you'd borne a son,

248
00:09:27,200 --> 00:09:28,080
you'd rise with him.

249
00:09:28,080 --> 00:09:30,120
The Fu family would be honored by now!

250
00:09:30,720 --> 00:09:32,960
If the Noble Consort sees
that you know your place

251
00:09:33,120 --> 00:09:34,880
and decides to help you,

252
00:09:34,880 --> 00:09:36,480
you could become an imperial consort

253
00:09:36,480 --> 00:09:37,800
and bear several princes.

254
00:09:37,880 --> 00:09:40,000
Then you'd enjoy endless riches!

255
00:09:40,120 --> 00:09:41,840
But if you keep resisting

256
00:09:42,440 --> 00:09:43,920
and anger the Noble Consort,

257
00:09:43,920 --> 00:09:45,600
ruining the Fu family's future,

258
00:09:45,800 --> 00:09:48,040
don't blame me for forgetting our bond.

259
00:09:49,560 --> 00:09:51,200
Stop being so stubborn.

260
00:09:51,440 --> 00:09:52,600
Lingxi is gone.

261
00:09:52,680 --> 00:09:54,240
You need to look ahead.

262
00:09:54,720 --> 00:09:57,000
I risked my life to
give birth to Lingxi.

263
00:09:57,400 --> 00:09:59,120
How could I let her die in vain?

264
00:09:59,360 --> 00:10:01,480
How could I let the killer go free?

265
00:10:02,400 --> 00:10:03,200
Mother.

266
00:10:03,680 --> 00:10:05,040
Li Chengyan and I

267
00:10:05,240 --> 00:10:06,360
were meant to be together.

268
00:10:06,720 --> 00:10:07,600
But you and father

269
00:10:07,720 --> 00:10:09,760
threatened me with grandmother's life

270
00:10:09,880 --> 00:10:11,120
and forced me to enter the palace.

271
00:10:11,920 --> 00:10:12,720
I obeyed.

272
00:10:13,120 --> 00:10:15,040
And I paid for it with my whole life.

273
00:10:15,840 --> 00:10:17,840
But I won't obey you this time.

274
00:10:18,280 --> 00:10:20,800
I will make Lingxi's killer

275
00:10:21,400 --> 00:10:22,640
pay with their life!

276
00:10:56,920 --> 00:10:58,280
(Who allowed you to stop?)

277
00:10:58,360 --> 00:10:59,080
(Even the donkey keeps going!)

278
00:10:59,080 --> 00:11:00,480
(You little brat, taking a break?)

279
00:11:00,720 --> 00:11:01,400
(Hurry!)

280
00:11:01,400 --> 00:11:01,880
(Hurry!)

281
00:11:03,960 --> 00:11:04,960
(Keep grinding!)

282
00:11:08,520 --> 00:11:09,320
(Faster!)

283
00:11:24,240 --> 00:11:25,360
(Don't make a sound.)

284
00:11:25,520 --> 00:11:26,480
(If you wake your brother,)

285
00:11:26,600 --> 00:11:27,760
(I'll beat you to death!)

286
00:11:30,160 --> 00:11:30,960
(Keep fanning!)

287
00:11:50,560 --> 00:11:51,360
No.

288
00:11:52,440 --> 00:11:53,920
You can't even feed him properly!

289
00:11:53,920 --> 00:11:54,920
What can you do right?

290
00:11:55,160 --> 00:11:57,640
He just won't eat.

291
00:11:57,760 --> 00:11:58,720
He's just a little boy.

292
00:11:58,720 --> 00:11:59,520
What does he know?

293
00:11:59,800 --> 00:12:00,920
How dare you talk back!

294
00:12:03,280 --> 00:12:04,480
I'll teach you to talk back!

295
00:12:04,600 --> 00:12:05,400
Still talking back?

296
00:12:05,520 --> 00:12:06,000
Mother.

297
00:12:06,000 --> 00:12:06,680
Still talking back?

298
00:12:06,760 --> 00:12:07,560
I won't do it again!

299
00:12:07,760 --> 00:12:08,200
Still talking back?

300
00:12:08,200 --> 00:12:09,440
I won't do it again...

301
00:12:09,520 --> 00:12:10,720
I'll beat you to death!

302
00:12:14,160 --> 00:12:14,960
Mother.

303
00:12:15,160 --> 00:12:16,160
I won't do it again.

304
00:12:16,480 --> 00:12:17,800
I promise I won't.

305
00:12:18,360 --> 00:12:19,440
I won't...

306
00:12:22,200 --> 00:12:25,160
Don't think entering the palace
will free you from the Fu family.

307
00:12:25,800 --> 00:12:27,160
For the rest of your life,

308
00:12:27,840 --> 00:12:29,360
you'll do as I say.

309
00:12:34,800 --> 00:12:36,240
Look at you. Pathetic!

310
00:12:36,760 --> 00:12:38,640
No dignity of a Zhaoyi.

311
00:12:38,880 --> 00:12:40,920
How did I give birth to such a waste?

312
00:12:44,240 --> 00:12:45,680
(Fu Residence)
I'm entering the palace.

313
00:12:46,120 --> 00:12:49,000
Everything between us is over.

314
00:12:49,760 --> 00:12:52,240
Just pretend we never knew each other.

315
00:12:52,320 --> 00:12:53,040
No!

316
00:12:53,200 --> 00:12:53,760
Rong.

317
00:12:53,760 --> 00:12:54,400
I don't believe you!

318
00:12:54,560 --> 00:12:55,360
You're not the kind of woman

319
00:12:55,360 --> 00:12:56,840
who chases wealth and power!

320
00:12:57,040 --> 00:12:57,720
Rong...

321
00:12:59,800 --> 00:13:00,960
(Fu Residence)
I am.

322
00:13:01,440 --> 00:13:03,200
Li Chengyan, listen carefully.

323
00:13:03,880 --> 00:13:05,720
We were never meant to be.

324
00:13:06,280 --> 00:13:08,320
Would marrying you give me a good life?

325
00:13:08,680 --> 00:13:09,400
If I married you,

326
00:13:09,680 --> 00:13:12,040
I'd be trapped in the household forever.

327
00:13:12,640 --> 00:13:13,760
Bearing children,

328
00:13:13,880 --> 00:13:14,720
keeping house,

329
00:13:15,080 --> 00:13:16,760
until I became a worn-out housewife.

330
00:13:16,920 --> 00:13:18,560
But the palace is different.

331
00:13:18,800 --> 00:13:19,600
Once inside,

332
00:13:19,800 --> 00:13:22,040
I could become His Majesty's woman.

333
00:13:22,120 --> 00:13:24,400
I'd have a chance to seize power

334
00:13:24,600 --> 00:13:26,000
and rise to the very top.

335
00:13:30,000 --> 00:13:31,520
This is the path I've chosen.

336
00:13:33,440 --> 00:13:34,240
Rong...

337
00:13:49,480 --> 00:13:52,080
(She endured all that suffering alone.)

338
00:13:53,160 --> 00:13:53,960
(So...)

339
00:13:54,760 --> 00:13:57,760
(She was forced into the palace
by her parents.)

340
00:13:58,640 --> 00:13:59,560
(All these years,)

341
00:14:00,240 --> 00:14:02,320
(She was trampled on in the palace.)

342
00:14:02,520 --> 00:14:03,520
(And plotted against.)

343
00:14:04,200 --> 00:14:06,400
(Even her only daughter was killed.)

344
00:14:07,280 --> 00:14:08,280
(How did she)

345
00:14:09,040 --> 00:14:10,760
(endure it all alone?)

346
00:14:13,000 --> 00:14:15,120
(Li Chengyan...)

347
00:14:16,720 --> 00:14:19,080
(You never did a thing to help her.)

348
00:14:19,520 --> 00:14:21,040
(There was nothing you could do)

349
00:14:21,560 --> 00:14:24,000
(to ease even a little of her pain.)

350
00:14:24,400 --> 00:14:25,400
(Worse still...)

351
00:14:25,800 --> 00:14:27,640
(You kept holding it against her)

352
00:14:28,200 --> 00:14:30,160
(for cutting you off back then.)

353
00:14:30,840 --> 00:14:32,760
(You deserve death.)

354
00:14:41,440 --> 00:14:42,120
Your Highness.

355
00:14:42,200 --> 00:14:44,160
Madam Zhao caused quite a scene
at Jinghe Palace.

356
00:14:44,280 --> 00:14:46,080
Zhaoyi Rong was clearly shaken.

357
00:14:46,120 --> 00:14:48,560
A little bell scared her half to death.

358
00:14:48,600 --> 00:14:49,560
It seems

359
00:14:49,800 --> 00:14:52,040
she's nothing but a paper tiger.

360
00:14:52,800 --> 00:14:54,960
I want her to suffer

361
00:14:54,960 --> 00:14:56,040
a fate worse than death.

362
00:14:56,520 --> 00:14:58,560
I'll torment her slowly to death

363
00:14:58,760 --> 00:15:00,920
until my hatred is sated.

364
00:15:01,360 --> 00:15:02,800
How clever, Your Highness.

365
00:15:05,880 --> 00:15:07,400
Isn't that Zhaoyi Rong?

366
00:15:07,880 --> 00:15:09,120
What happened to you?

367
00:15:09,520 --> 00:15:11,280
Did seeing your mother move you so?

368
00:15:12,160 --> 00:15:15,400
You brought my mother here
just to humiliate me?

369
00:15:16,280 --> 00:15:17,320
Noble Consort Hui.

370
00:15:17,560 --> 00:15:19,240
You throw your weight around

371
00:15:19,240 --> 00:15:20,400
and treat lives as worthless.

372
00:15:20,800 --> 00:15:22,480
Aren't you afraid of retribution?

373
00:15:25,360 --> 00:15:26,680
I am a Noble Consort.

374
00:15:26,960 --> 00:15:28,400
The Empress Dowager's own niece.

375
00:15:28,640 --> 00:15:29,600
And what are you?

376
00:15:30,120 --> 00:15:31,280
A low official's daughter,

377
00:15:31,280 --> 00:15:33,120
climbing from a seventh-rank
to a Zhaoyi.

378
00:15:33,240 --> 00:15:35,040
You have no power or family backing.

379
00:15:35,040 --> 00:15:36,360
How can you fight me?

380
00:15:37,400 --> 00:15:39,040
You think a little cleverness

381
00:15:39,040 --> 00:15:40,160
can hurt me?

382
00:15:40,480 --> 00:15:42,040
How naive.

383
00:15:42,480 --> 00:15:44,480
If you dare, come after me.

384
00:15:44,720 --> 00:15:46,640
Threatening my family...

385
00:15:46,840 --> 00:15:48,280
Is that all you've got?

386
00:15:51,680 --> 00:15:52,840
In this harem,

387
00:15:53,200 --> 00:15:54,960
my word is the rule.

388
00:15:55,080 --> 00:15:56,840
Whatever I do is justice.

389
00:15:57,160 --> 00:15:58,840
That's what power means.

390
00:15:59,360 --> 00:16:01,280
I was born above you.

391
00:16:01,880 --> 00:16:04,920
You'll never reach the heights
I stand on.

392
00:16:06,600 --> 00:16:08,040
That's your fate.

393
00:16:09,120 --> 00:16:10,360
I, Fu Rong,

394
00:16:10,960 --> 00:16:12,800
may have no power or influence,

395
00:16:13,320 --> 00:16:15,600
and no family to back me.

396
00:16:18,000 --> 00:16:19,480
But I'll risk my life

397
00:16:19,640 --> 00:16:21,120
to challenge you.

398
00:16:22,480 --> 00:16:23,680
I swear

399
00:16:23,880 --> 00:16:25,440
I'll ruin your reputation

400
00:16:26,200 --> 00:16:28,000
and grind your bones to dust.

401
00:16:28,920 --> 00:16:30,120
From this day on,

402
00:16:30,560 --> 00:16:32,080
it's war to the death!

403
00:16:32,880 --> 00:16:34,360
Let's see who wins.

404
00:16:35,000 --> 00:16:36,520
Either you die,

405
00:16:37,000 --> 00:16:38,360
or I do!

406
00:16:43,720 --> 00:16:48,200
♪I've wandered through this world
all my life♪

407
00:16:48,640 --> 00:16:53,240
♪As the years go by,
we learn to be alone♪

408
00:16:53,440 --> 00:16:58,040
♪I see leaves fall from the old tree
by my window♪

409
00:16:58,280 --> 00:17:02,880
♪When flowers bloom and swallows return,
I hope you are still here♪

410
00:17:03,160 --> 00:17:07,640
♪I hear rain whisper in my ear♪

411
00:17:08,080 --> 00:17:12,680
♪I send my longing to you far away♪

412
00:17:12,880 --> 00:17:17,480
♪I wait for dawn to break the mist
and you to find your way home♪

413
00:17:17,840 --> 00:17:22,440
♪Let the stars and sea
wait for your return♪

414
00:17:22,600 --> 00:17:27,200
♪Let the stars and sea
wait for your return♪

415
00:17:27,480 --> 00:17:30,640
♪Let the stars and sea♪

416
00:17:30,640 --> 00:17:32,140
(Changsheng Gate)

417
00:17:32,140 --> 00:17:35,960
♪Wait for your return♪
